## Notes
- Live: https://datagovai-web.vercel.app
- Ingested GRS-19374, GRS-19375, GRS-11284 (plus earlier sample series)
- Citation chips: only series ids named in the answer

## Lessons
- Prefer simpler Vercel-style chatbot patterns when user points to a working reference.
- Do not copy CareWise domain logic; reuse only RAG plumbing ideas and existing Vercel/Neon credentials.
- CareWise Neon org is Vercel-managed — create a new *database* on the existing project rather than a new Neon project.
- AI SDK v6 `toUIMessageStreamResponse` `onFinish` has `messages`, not `text`.
- `process.env.VERCEL_OIDC_TOKEN` is NOT auto-injected into a deployed Vercel function's `process.env`.
- Use the `ai` package's own `embed`/`embedMany`/`rerank` with gateway model strings.
- Gateway rerank model id is `voyage/rerank-2.5`.
- Production chat requires a visible Sign in path; a raw 401 looks like the app is broken.
- Starter prompts must match ingested GRS PDFs or retrieval returns the wrong series.
- `vercel deploy --prod --yes` can hang after upload even when the deployment actually succeeds.
- Root `.gitignore` must not use a global `lib/` rule — it hides `web/src/lib` from git.
